kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "app-tui-session-tree"
purpose: "产品面双 Esc 会话树 stub（c491 冻结）：仅槽替换与 travel 行；活树/真 Driver 等开闸。形态学见 agent_demo（ast3/ast4）。"
valid_scope[1]: src/app/tui/
requirements[5]{req_id,title,statement}:
  meta0,"capability-shell","本 capability 由变更 c491-add-app-tui-session-tree 引入；归档合并后以 delta 增补的 requirements 为准。本壳 MUST 保持非空以满足 BDD 护栏。"
  ast1,"slot-replace",会话树打开时 MUST 替换 UiRoot editor 槽（贴底可见）；MUST NOT 画成内容区顶部 overlay。
  ast2,"travel-stub","Enter 选中节点时 MUST 记录 travel 目标 id 并关闭树；本切片 MUST NOT reach agent::session 或 infra session。"
  ast3,"demo-live-session-tree","在产品真 session 图接线前，packages/xylitol-tui agent_demo MUST 维护可变 session_tree：用户提交、工具事件与助手回复结束 MUST 在当前 history leaf 下挂对应节点并推进 leaf；双 Esc 打开的树 MUST 渲染该活树而非仅静态样例。"
  ast4,"demo-travel-reply-spine","agent_demo 在会话树 Enter travel 时 MUST 重建 root→选中节点路径上的 transcript，并 MUST 继续纳入其后单链的 assistant:/tool: 回复节点；history leaf MUST 落到该显示路径末端；完成后 status MUST 回到空闲（无 spinner）。"
scenarios[6]{req_id,id,given,when,then}:
  meta0,"shell-present","","列出 llmanspec/specs/app-tui-session-tree",spec.toon 存在且 purpose 为中文
  ast1,"double-esc-opens",空编辑器,双 Esc 于 500ms 内,editor 槽显示 Session tree
  ast2,"enter-closes",树已打开,Enter,树关闭且 transcript 含 travel 目标 id
  ast3,"submit-grows-tree",agent_demo 已打开,提交唯一 user 文本,session_tree 含该文本且再开树可见
  ast3,"tool-grows-tree",agent_demo 脚本轮产生 Tool,推进 tick 至工具出现,"session_tree 含 tool: 节点"
  ast4,"travel-user-keeps-reply",样例树在 u1 下有线性 assistant 子节点,travel 到 u1,transcript 含 user 文案与 assistant 回复且 leaf 为回复链末端
